{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08281","headline":"赠裴司马 · 李白","name":"赠裴司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翡翠黄金缕，绣成歌舞衣。\n若无云间月，谁可比光辉。\n秀色一如此，多爲衆女讥。\n君恩移昔爱，失宠秋风归。\n愁苦不窥隣，泣上流黄机。\n天寒素手冷，夜长烛复微。\n十日不满匹，鬓蓬乱若丝。\n犹是可怜人，容华世中稀。\n向君发皓齿，顾我莫相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}